    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我打开了电影，苹果也打开了电影。",
      "traditional": "我打開了電影，蘋果也打開了電影。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ dǎ kāi le diàn yǐng píng guǒ yě dǎ kāi le diàn yǐng",
      "english": "I started a movie, and Apple also started a movie."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "一分钟后，大星妈妈听见我们了。她看看苹果手机，也看看我。",
      "traditional": "一分鐘後，大星媽媽聽見我們了。她看看蘋果手機，也看看我。",
      "pinyin": "yì fēn zhōng hòu dà xīng mā ma tīng jiàn wǒ men le tā kàn kan píng guǒ shǒu jī yě kàn kan wǒ",
      "english": "One minute later, Daxing’s mom heard us. She looked at the Apple phone and also looked at me. "
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "大星也听见我们了，他来了。我打开了电影、TikTok、Facebook、Radio……这些APP我都打开了。",
      "traditional": "大星也聽見我們了，他來了。我打開了電影、TikTok、Facebook、Radio……這些APP我都打開了。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng yě tīng jiàn wǒ men le tā lái le wǒ dǎ kāi le diàn yǐng 10 zhè xiē 3 wǒ dōu dǎ kāi le",
      "english": "Daxing heard us too. He came over. I opened Movies, TikTok, Facebook, Radio … I opened all these apps."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "大星，你看，你要听我的！我回大星手里了，但是我的身体太热了，太热了，",
      "traditional": "大星，你看，你要聽我的！我回大星手裡了，但是我的身體太熱了，太熱了，",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng nǐ kàn nǐ yào tīng wǒ de wǒ huí dà xīng shǒu lǐ le dàn shì wǒ de shēn tǐ tài rè le tài rè le",
      "english": "Daxing, look, you have to listen to me! I was back in Daxing’s hands, but my body was too hot, too hot."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我不知道大星在说什么……我听不见了…….我看不见大星了…….",
      "traditional": "我不知道大星在說什麼……我聽不見了…….我看不見大星了…….",
      "pinyin": "wǒ bù zhī dào dà xīng zài shuō shén me wǒ tīng bú jiàn le wǒ kàn bú jiàn dà xīng le",
      "english": "I didn’t know what Daxing was saying … I couldn’t hear him … I couldn’t see Daxing anymore …"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "十分钟后。",
      "traditional": "十分鐘後。",
      "pinyin": "shí fēn zhōng hòu",
      "english": "Ten minutes later. "
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "“小米！小米！！”苹果叫我。",
      "traditional": "“小米！小米！！”蘋果叫我。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo mǐ xiǎo mǐ píng guǒ jiào wǒ",
      "english": "“Xiaomi! Xiaomi!!” Apple called out to me. "
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "我看看苹果，问：“我在哪儿？我怎么了？”",
      "traditional": "我看看蘋果，問：“我在哪兒？我怎麼了？”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ kàn kan píng guǒ wèn wǒ zài nǎ'r wǒ zěn me le",
      "english": "I looked at Apple and asked, “Where am I? What’s the matter with me?”"
    }
