    "sentence_translations": [
      "Too Hot",
      "",
      "I started a movie, and Apple also started a movie.",
      "",
      "One minute later, Daxing’s mom heard us. She looked at the Apple phone and also looked at me. ",
      "Daxing heard us too. He came over. I opened Movies, TikTok, Facebook, Radio … I opened all these apps.",
      "",
      "Daxing, look, you have to listen to me! I was back in Daxing’s hands, but my body was too hot, too hot.",
      "I didn’t know what Daxing was saying … I couldn’t hear him … I couldn’t see Daxing anymore …",
      "",
      "Ten minutes later. ",
      "",
      "“Xiaomi! Xiaomi!!” Apple called out to me. ",
      "",
      "I looked at Apple and asked, “Where am I? What’s the matter with me?”"
